<title>UK: Deutsche Schiffsbank adds 50 mln marks to Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Schiffsbank adds 50 mln marks to Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was increased to 200 million marks from 150 million marks joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SCHIFFSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY    30.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.10    PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    BREMEN    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 30.JUL.97 THEN STEPS-UP TO 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		CALLABLE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
